<view class="page"><nav-bar title="转移主管理员" /><view class="pad">
  <text class="h1">选择新的主管理员</text><text class="sub mt-12">只能转移给已接受邀请的家庭成员。转移成功后，双方权限立即更新。</text>
  <text class="qa-note mt-12" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在读取家庭成员…</text>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card card-p"><text class="danger">{{error}}</text><button class="btn btn-secondary mt-12" bindtap="reload">重试</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{done}}" class="card card-p mt-20"><text class="h2">主管理权已转移</text><text class="sub mt-12">你现在是普通成员，可继续查看已授权的孩子信息。</text></view>
  <block wx:elif="{{!loading && !error && isAdmin}}">
    <button class="item list-button" wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="between"><text class="h3">{{item.name}} · {{item.relation}}</text><text class="pill {{selectedId===item.id ? 'pill-sky' : ''}}">{{selectedId===item.id ? '已选择' : '选择'}}</text></view></button>
    <text class="sub mt-12" wx:if="{{!members.length}}">暂无可接任成员，请先在家庭管理中处理成员邀请。</text>
    <button class="btn btn-primary mt-24" bindtap="go" disabled="{{busy || !selectedId}}" loading="{{busy}}">确认转移</button>
  </block>
  <text wx:elif="{{!loading && !error}}" class="qa-note mt-20">仅主管理员可转移管理权。</text>
  <view class="task-state mt-16" wx:if="{{task}}"><text class="sub">{{task.message}}</text></view>
</view></view>
